      "t": "2026-11-20T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "A Russian Kh-101 cruise missile struck a field near the village of Nowy Lipowiec in Lublin Voivodeship, Poland, around 60 miles from a Coalition of the Willing training exercise.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-20:4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-20T00:00:09Z",
      "text": "The case also belongs to a wider record of airspace violations during the Russo-Ukrainian war (2022–present), including a drone found near Ceadîr-Lunga, Moldova, on February 13, 2025.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1386835291:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-20T00:00:18Z",
      "text": "The reports place the strike near Nowy Lipowiec in Poland.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-20:4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-20T00:00:26Z",
      "text": "The reports also name Lublin Voivodeship and Podkarpackie Voivodeship, where air raid alerts were issued.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-20:4"
      ]
    },
